{"id":137,"name":"porygon","speciesId":137,"dex":137,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["normal"],"stats":{"hp":65,"attack":60,"defense":70,"special-attack":85,"special-defense":75,"speed":40},"abilities":[{"name":"trace","hidden":false},{"name":"download","hidden":false},{"name":"analytic","hidden":true}],"height":8,"weight":365,"baseExp":79,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/137.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/137.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/137.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/137.ogg","genus":"Virtual Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon virtuais","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"A POKéMON that consists entirely of programming code. Capable of moving freely in cyberspace."},{"version":"yellow","text":"The only POKéMON people anticipate can fly into space. None has managed the feat yet, however."},{"version":"gold","text":"It is a manmade POKéMON. Since it doesn't breathe, people are eager to try it in any environment."},{"version":"silver","text":"A manmade POKéMON that came about as a result of re­ search. It is pro­ grammed with only basic motions."},{"version":"crystal","text":"An artificial POKéMON created due to extensive research, it can perform only what is in its program."},{"version":"ruby","text":"PORYGON is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data and entering cyberspace. This POKéMON is copy-protected so it cannot be duplicated by copying."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It is capable of reverting itself entirely back to program data in order to enter cyberspace. A PORYGON is copy- protected so it cannot be duplicated."},{"version":"firered","text":"Using the most advanced technologies, scientists finally succeeded in making the first artificial POKéMON."},{"versi